 "name": "Social Web Incubator Community Group",
 "is_closed": false,
 "creation-date": "2016-11-18",
 "description": "<p>The Social Web Incubator Community Group (also known as SocialCG, or SWICG) incubates protocols and other technology for on open social web in which everybody can participate. We work closely with the <a href=\"https://www.w3.org/groups/wg/social/\">Social Web Working Group</a>, which uses the W3C process to formally standardize these technologies.</p>\n\n<p>For current work, consult the links and posts on this page. Please join the Community Group if you wish to participate actively in the group or contribute substantively to the group’s deliverables. We also invite you to ask questions on the group’s public mailing list, or to contact the Chairs if you wish to join a specific meeting.</p>",
